# viewer-fit-800x600 (fix-viewer-size): the viewer page at an 800 x 600
# window. The reference's grid gives the header (16, 16, 768, 64), the
# sidebar (16, 96, 400, 488) with its content clipped at the padding box
# (client 486) and scrolling, and the canvas (432, 96, 352, 488) - the
# plane narrower than tall, the case where the row's share of the window
# is smallest.
size 800 600
density 2
scheme dark
mode dark
theme arctic-ice
wait 2000
shot viewer-fit-800x600
